@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:先ほど名乗ったとおりだ。別に何者でもない。<br>はい、次、そこの！|#0201Adv04_Hiro020| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:ひぃっ！<br>ひ、氷上メルル、です……っ|#0201Adv04_Meruru001| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

