[PrintTextModified Text:反抗的な眼差しを私に向ける少女、紫藤アリサと、<br>自由気ままな少女、城ケ崎ノア。|#0201Adv04_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1

